## Git-native content

Content is JSON, Markdoc, and media in a Git repository. Each save creates one atomic commit. Per-path revision checks reject stale writes.

## One content model

A plain module defines types, runtime validation, editor forms, Astro collections, and the file layout. No code generation keeps these parts in step.

## A focused runtime

The first release includes local, GitHub, and GitLab connectors, OpenID Connect authentication for production, a Vue editing interface, and a Hono server with SQLite for accounts and sessions.

Mica is experimental and pre-1.0. A minor version can include a breaking change.
